  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "つよい　あいてに　たちむかうときほど\nたてがみが　こうおんになり\nぜんしんに　ちからが　みなぎるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강한 상대에게 맞설 때일수록\n갈기의 온도가 높아지고\n전신에 힘이 넘쳐난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Plus l’adversaire auquel il est confronté est fort,\nplus la température de sa crinière augmente, l’énergie\ngénérée se diffusant alors dans tout son corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Je stärker sein Gegner ist, desto heißer wird seine\nMähne und umso kraftvoller wird es.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto más poderoso es el enemigo al que se\nenfrenta, más calor desprende su mechón y más\nenergía recorre todo su cuerpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Più l’avversario che affronta è temibile, più la sua\ncriniera si scalda, aumentandone la forza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The stronger the opponent it faces,\nthe more heat surges from its mane\nand the more power flows through its body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "強い　相手に　立ち向かうときほど\nたてがみが　高温になり\n全身に　力が　みなぎるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto más poderoso es el enemigo al que se\nenfrenta, más calor desprende su mechón y más\nenergía recorre todo su cuerpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つよくなるため　むれを　はなれて\n１ぴきで　せいかつするようになる。\nけっきさかんで　けんかっぱやい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강해지기 위해 무리를 벗어나\n홀로 생활하게 된다.\n혈기 왕성하여 쉽게 싸우려 든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il n’hésite pas à quitter la horde et à mener une\nexistence solitaire pour mieux pouvoir s’entraîner.\nIl a le sang chaud et ne rechigne pas au combat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie verlassen ihr Rudel schon sehr früh, um stärker\nzu werden und auf eigenen Pfoten zu stehen.\nSie sind sehr hitzköpfig und streitlustig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se separa de su manada para hacerse más fuerte\ny aprender a valerse por sí mismo. Su excesiva\nfogosidad le hace saltar a la mínima.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si allontana dal gruppo e inizia una vita solitaria per\ndiventare più forte. Ha un carattere impetuoso ed è\nsempre pronto a gettarsi nella mischia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They set off on their own from their pride\nand live by themselves to become stronger.\nThese hot-blooded Pokémon are quick to fight.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "強くなるため　群れを　離れて\n１匹で　生活するようになる。\n血気盛んで　ケンカっ早い。",
