        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어릴 때는 동료와 무리를 이룬다.\n스스로 먹이를 사냥할 수 있게 되면\n무리에서 쫓겨나 독립한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "小時候會和夥伴們群居在一起，\n當成長到能自己捕捉獵物之後，\n就會被趕出群體獨立生活。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est élevé avec ses congénères au sein\nde la troupe, mais dès qu’il peut chasser seul,\nil doit partir et vivre par ses propres moyens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bis es seine Beute selbst fangen kann, bewegt\nes sich in Rudeln. Danach wird es verstoßen und\nmuss auf eigenen Pfoten stehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mientras es solo una cría vive con el resto de la\nmanada, pero en cuanto aprende a cazar se\nsepara del grupo y se independiza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da piccolo vive in gruppo con i suoi simili, ma\nappena impara a catturare da solo le sue prede\nviene allontanato e diventa indipendente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When they’re young, they live with a pride. Once\nthey’re able to hunt prey on their own, they’re\nkicked out and have to make their own way.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "幼い頃は　仲間と　群れている。\n自分で　獲物を　狩るようになると\n群れから　追い出され　独り立ちする。",
